    <h1 class="submission-title font-serif mb-0">Super-Resolution for Renewable Energy Resource Data with Climate Change Impacts (Sup3rCC)</h1>

    <div class="submission-main">
      <div class="submission-abstract w-100">
        <div class="submission-main-group">

